labelled: 2026-10-02
--- code
export function clearingWorkerAddress(scriptUrl: string): string {
  return `${testClientRoot}/clearing-worker.js?script=${encodeURIComponent(scriptUrl)}`;
}
--- facts
The test client's `clearing-worker.js` imports whatever script its `script` query parameter points at. The worker registered at the returned address therefore runs the script the caller passed in.
